# $crate_package_name Python package

UniFFI-generated Python package for the [`$crate_package_name`](../../../crates/$crate_package_name) content-hash primitive.

Generate the package from the repo root:

```bash
just generate-python-bindings $crate_package_name
```

The generated module exposes `hash_jcs_bytes(bytes) -> str`, returning the SDK's 32-character lowercase XXH3-128 content hash.

`setup.py` marks the distribution as binary so wheel builds are platform-tagged instead of `py3-none-any`.
